    "detailed_description": "<h1>\u2728\ud83d\udd0d  mystical detective furry visual novel  \ud83d\udc7b\u2728</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953170/extras/e6133ab410f52294caa536562a4dc62b.poster.avif?t=1754985954\" width=622 height=227 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953170/extras/e6133ab410f52294caa536562a4dc62b.webm?t=1754985954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953170/extras/1c46c874df36dc86ab0243661975492b.avif?t=1754985954\" width=615 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's more alluring than the charm of fantasy worlds? Answer: the same, but with sex. So much sex and magic. Swords and witchcraft , dungeons, dragons and breathtaking intimate adventures. What more can one wish for? After all, fantasy can make the boldest and wettest of dreams come true. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953170/extras/451fb36d37abfa15d6ba7abc6d6dabf2.webp?t=1754985954\" width=615 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly \u2014 all our stories do indeed have a happy\u2026 ending! The war between vampires and werewolves is destined to come to a close resolution. The hero squad, with their supplied and favourite dice, will depart for the dungeons and meet a much... warmer welcome than they expected. The dragon, the princess and the knight will see they have nothing to fight over \u2014 and it's time to start sharing. And the fairies of the magic forest set their sights on a solitary explorer, ready to do anything to make him stay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953170/extras/451fb36d37abfa15d6ba7abc6d6dabf2.webp?t=1754985954\" width=615 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In these series you can pick a character who suits you more</strong> \u2764\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What would you prefer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hot classic? \ud83c\udf46\ud83c\udf51</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steamy manly embraces? \ud83c\udf46\ud83c\udf46</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tender feminine care? \ud83c\udf51\ud83c\udf51</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our all at once? \ud83d\udc40 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This time we intend to satisfy every request!</strong> \u2764\ufe0f </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So don your cloaks and armour, pick your weapons \u2014 and begin the quest for love and adventure! Don't worry, we already rolled a Critical Success for you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953170/extras/451fb36d37abfa15d6ba7abc6d6dabf2.webp?t=1754985954\" width=615 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Several fantasy stories where you can choose your character\u2019s gender!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Original illustrations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Longer animated sex scenes with sound effects and voiceover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Branching narrative, hard choices, sloppy rewards </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Updated Match-3 gameplay with new goals and features </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953170/extras/9a24e41c09f95a0abbab74c8f6e2d272.webp?t=1754985954\" width=612 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953170/extras/924650f590dc396d1e2157ed6f0cfd7b.webp?t=1754985954\" width=612 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
